  "details": "When launching from Steam, it displays a white screen and becomes unresponsive.　Checking file integrity, uninstalling and reinstalling (which had worked previously), and restarting the PC were all ineffective. I was able to launch `vrchat.exe` directly from the `Program Files (x86)` folder, but since it bypassed EAC, it resulted in an offline state. In fact, it might be more accurate to assume that the application simply fails to launch when EAC is involved. I have attached the logs from both the successful launch (bypassing EAC) and the failed launch (using EAC).",
